<title>MOROCCO: SOCCER-MOROCCO BEAT SENEGAL 3-0 IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MOROCCO BEAT SENEGAL 3-0 IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-07-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco beat Senegal 3-0 (halftime</p>
<p>2-0) in African Nations Cup group three final round match on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Salahdine Bassir 11, 67, Said Chiba 40</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000.</p>
</text>
